    "createdAt": "2026-10-06T20:16:16.854Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "9a218111-e718-456e-b7db-bdf421b74221",
    "articleId": "78bec033-f117-4a8d-9a22-4a1544f15a32",
    "version": 2,
    "content": "<h2>Add the mailbox</h2><p>In Outlook on the web, right-click your name and choose Add shared folder. Enter the mailbox address and select Add.</p><p>To send as the mailbox, use the From dropdown when composing.</p>",
    "changeNote": "Added screenshots and the escalation path",
    "authorId": "8c30a256-55ea-4650-8fb5-58a336b1bf8b",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-06T20:16:16.854Z"
  },
